{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"683","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"J. The Hero with Bombs"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In a new computer game you need to help the hero to get out of the maze, which is a rectangular field of size "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n × m"},{"kind":"text","text":". The hero is located in one of the cells of this field. He knows where the exit of the maze is, and he wants to reach it."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In one move, the hero can either move to the next cell (i.e. the cell which has a common side with the current cell) if it is free, or plant a bomb on the cell where he is, or skip the move and do nothing. A planted bomb explodes after three moves, that is, after the hero makes 3 more actions but does not have time to make the fourth (all three types of moves described above are considered as actions)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The explosion destroys the obstacles in all the cells which have at least one common point with this cell (i.e. in all the cells sharing with the bomb cell a corner or a side). The explosion must not hurt the cell with the exit or the cell with the hero. The hero can not go beyond the boundaries of the maze."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to determine the sequence of hero's actions to reach the exit. Note that you haven't to minimize the length of the sequence. The only restriction — the length of the resulting sequence should not exceed 100,000 symbols."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n, m ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n·m > 1"},{"kind":"text","text":") — sizes of the maze."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the following "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" characters — description of the maze. The character \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" means a free cell, \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" — the hero, \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"T"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" — the exit, \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"X"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" — the obstacle."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that there is exactly one hero and exactly one exit in the maze."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the hero's actions which will help him get out of the maze (\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"M"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" — to plant a bomb, \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"T"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" — to skip the move, \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"S"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" — to go down, \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"W"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" — to go left, \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"N"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" — to go up, \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" — to go right). If the hero can not reach the exit, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"No solution"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The length of the resulting sequence should not exceed 100,000 symbols. If there are several solutions it is allowed to print any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 5\nXEX.X\nX.XXT\nX.X.X\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"SSMNNTSSNEMWWTEEEE\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"J","problemCode":"683J","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/683/problem/J"}